      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Merge pull request #15: Add four learning languages

Add German, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese and Mandarin with optional pinyin, native UI coverage and live iPhone verification.

Includes three native language screenshots and retains Richard Guerre&amp;#39;s original Mandarin contribution credit. Proficient-speaker validation continues in #16.&lt;/pre&gt;
