    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Add German, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese and Mandarin learning

Add regional modules, Chinese word lookup and optional word-based pinyin.
Preserve source text, language-specific progress and archive compatibility.
Verify native onboarding, accessibility, backend locales and live iPhone flows.

Builds on the Mandarin module contributed in Chuloo/mural#4.
Refs #10, #11, #12, #13.

Co-authored-by: Richard Guerre &amp;lt;richard@guerren.co&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
